{"id":"c1","kind":"doc","slide":1,"text":"anydoc 0.2.4는 Office·ODF·RTF·EPUB·CSV와 모든 page에 extractable text가 있는 PDF를 local Markdown으로 변환한다","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"firecrawl/anydoc@261fc257 README의 supported formats와 text-based PDF contract 기준. image-only page와 standalone image는 포함하지 않는다","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"README.md:137","quote":"anydoc reads text-based PDFs locally but does no OCR, so a PDF with scanned or image-only pages fails with `NeedsOcr`. Opt in and those documents go to [Firecrawl Parse](https://firecrawl.dev/parse), which OCRs them and returns the same Markdown."},{"source":"r1","locator":"README.md:159","quote":"| Word             | `.doc`, `.docx`, `.docm`                                   |\n| PowerPoint       | `.ppt`, `.pps`, `.pot`, `.pptx`, `.pptm`, `.ppsx`, `.ppsm` |\n| Excel            | `.xls`, `.xlsx`, `.xlsm`, `.xlsb`                          |\n| OpenDocument     | `.odt`, `.ods`, `.odp`                                     |"}]}
{"id":"c2","kind":"code","slide":4,"text":"Office 계열은 공통 Document model과 Markdown renderer를 거치지만 PDF는 pdf-inspector가 Markdown을 직접 만들어 그 model을 우회한다","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"firecrawl/anydoc@261fc257 Rust core의 to_markdown_bytes path 기준","evidence":[{"source":"r1","locator":"src/lib.rs:116","quote":"// PDFs convert to Markdown directly (pdf-inspector) without passing\n    // through the document model.\n    if format == Format::Pdf {\n        return formats::pdf::to_markdown(bytes);\n    }\n    Ok(document_to_markdown(&to_document(bytes, format)?))"}]}
